    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "ואכל ושבע ודשן",
      "rationale": "Kuma-woro tilennen filafila: dun, sagala, kɔgɔ — ɲɔgɔndan bɛ kuma ninnu cɛ, a bɛ tiɲɛ bali sira jira."
    }
