  "translation": "Sabu n bɛna ⟨u⟩ don dugukolo la min bɛ nsira ni shi jiri, min kɔrɔ n ye seere kɛ a faamaw ma, u bɛna dun, u bɛna sagala, u bɛna kɔgɔ bɔ, u bɛna fɛlɛ ka tugu alaw wɛrɛw, ka u baara kɛ, ka n ye ko jugu, ani ⟨u⟩ bɛna ⟨את⟩ n ka layidu tiɲɛ bali.",
